@startuml
actor Traveller
participant "React app" as Web
participant "Spring API" as API
database MongoDB
participant Razorpay

Traveller -> Web: Search and select a flight / seat
Web -> API: POST /api/bookings + Idempotency-Key
API -> MongoDB: atomically reserve available seat
API -> MongoDB: insert PENDING_PAYMENT booking
API --> Web: booking + PNR
Web -> API: POST /payments/order
API -> Razorpay: create INR order (server credentials)
Razorpay --> API: order_id
API --> Web: checkout order + public key id
Web -> Razorpay: Razorpay Checkout
Razorpay --> Web: payment_id + signature
Web -> API: POST /payments/verify
API -> MongoDB: atomically transition PENDING_PAYMENT to PAYMENT_PROCESSING
API -> API: verify HMAC signature
API -> Razorpay: fetch payment status / amount / currency
Razorpay --> API: captured payment details
API -> MongoDB: set booking CONFIRMED
API --> Web: confirmed e-ticket / PNR

note over API,MongoDB
The pending-to-processing transition includes
an unexpired-hold condition. Expiry and payment
verification cannot both win the transition.
end note
@enduml
